{"route":"/docs/6.0/helpers/hover-lift/","version":"6.0","renderedVersion":"6.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Hover lift","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Raise an element with a subtle transform and shadow on hover and keyboard focus."},"blocks":[{"id":"how-it-works","type":"heading","en":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add <code>.hover-lift</code> to any element to gently raise it—translating it upward and deepening its shadow—when the user hovers over it or focuses it with the keyboard. It’s a lightweight way to signal that cards, tiles, or other surfaces are interactive."},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"The effect is driven by CSS custom properties and applied with our <code>transition()</code> mixin, so it’s fully customizable and automatically honors the <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/accessibility#reduced-motion\"><code>prefers-reduced-motion</code></a> media feature—users who prefer reduced motion get the raised shadow and offset without the animation."},{"id":"example","type":"heading","en":"Example","level":2},{"id":"example--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Hover or tab to the card below to see it lift."},{"id":"example--example-1","type":"demo","key":"2340d0bcd0fffbf3b524","height":147},{"id":"example--code-1","type":"code","value":"<a href=\"#\" class=\"card hover-lift text-decoration-none\" style=\"max-width: 20rem;\">\n  <div class=\"card-body\">\n    <h5 class=\"card-title\">Hover me</h5>\n    <p class=\"card-text mb-0\">This card lifts on hover and keyboard focus.</p>\n  </div>\n</a>","language":""},{"id":"example--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Because it only sets <code>transform</code> and <code>box-shadow</code>, <code>.hover-lift</code> composes with any element—buttons, list items, or plain containers."},{"id":"example--example-2","type":"demo","key":"95b640ee59a7b1cf5060","height":147},{"id":"example--code-2","type":"code","value":"<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-solid theme-primary hover-lift\">Lift on hover</button>","language":""},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"variables","type":"heading","en":"Variables","level":3},{"id":"variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Hover lift helpers use local CSS variables on <code>.hover-lift</code> for real-time customization. Values for the CSS variables are generated from Sass maps unique to each component and applied to the aforementioned class."},{"id":"variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"// stylelint-disable-next-line scss/dollar-variable-default\n$hover-lift-tokens: defaults(\n  (\n    --hover-lift-transition-duration: .2s,\n    --hover-lift-transition-timing: ease,\n    --hover-lift-transform: translateY(-.25rem),\n    --hover-lift-box-shadow: var(--box-shadow-lg),\n  ),\n  $hover-lift-tokens\n);","language":""},{"id":"variables--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Override the tokens to tune the lift distance, shadow, or timing. For example, a larger rise with a snappier transition:"},{"id":"variables--example-1","type":"demo","key":"0f4441efcaeae6437e04","height":147},{"id":"variables--code-2","type":"code","value":"<a href=\"#\" class=\"card hover-lift text-decoration-none\" style=\"--bs-hover-lift-transform: translateY(-.5rem); --bs-hover-lift-transition-duration: .1s; max-width: 20rem;\">\n  <div class=\"card-body\">\n    <h5 class=\"card-title\">Bigger lift</h5>\n    <p class=\"card-text mb-0\">Customized transform and duration.</p>\n  </div>\n</a>","language":""}],"demos":[{"key":"2340d0bcd0fffbf3b524","html":"<a href=\"#\" class=\"card hover-lift text-decoration-none\" style=\"max-width: 20rem;\">\n  <div class=\"card-body\">\n    <h5 class=\"card-title\">Hover me</h5>\n    <p class=\"card-text mb-0\">This card lifts on hover and keyboard focus.</p>\n  </div>\n</a>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example bg-1"},"sprite":""},{"key":"95b640ee59a7b1cf5060","html":"<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-solid theme-primary hover-lift\">Lift on hover</button>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example bg-1 d-flex gap-3"},"sprite":""},{"key":"0f4441efcaeae6437e04","html":"<a href=\"#\" class=\"card hover-lift text-decoration-none\" style=\"--bs-hover-lift-transform: translateY(-.5rem); --bs-hover-lift-transition-duration: .1s; max-width: 20rem;\">\n  <div class=\"card-body\">\n    <h5 class=\"card-title\">Bigger lift</h5>\n    <p class=\"card-text mb-0\">Customized transform and duration.</p>\n  </div>\n</a>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example bg-1"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Install","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/install"},{"en":"AI","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/ai"},{"en":"Approach","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/approach"},{"en":"CSS variables","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/css-variables"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/javascript"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/browsers-devices"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/accessibility"},{"en":"Quickstart","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/quickstart"},{"en":"npm","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/npm"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/webpack"},{"en":"Parcel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/parcel"},{"en":"Vite","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/vite"},{"en":"Contribute","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/contribute"},{"en":"Migration","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/migration"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/customize/overview"},{"en":"Sass","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/customize/sass"},{"en":"Options","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/customize/options"